# L_disch_self_Rollup_challengeState_489_493: a successful call is within the gas ceiling (En_G, D2)
def claim_disch_self_Rollup_challengeState_489_493(+s: M.GSt, x: M.HAct, +kh: List<&2, M.HKB>) -> Bool:
